## Input

```css
@media (#{$query} and (color)) {
  .and-query { color: red; }
}

@media (#{$query} or (color)) {
  .or-query { color: red; }
}

@media (#{$query} and not (color)) {
  .not-query { color: red; }
}

@font-face {
  font: { family: serif; }
  src: url(font.woff2);
}

@media (min-width: 10px + 1px) {
  .arithmetic-query { color: red; }
}

.bracketed {
  number: [1];
  group: [(1 + 2)];
  variable: [$value];
  function: [fn(1)];
  color: red;
}

.after { color: blue; }

```


